### 1.10.0.301（2023-02-27）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:-----------------------------------------------------------|:----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-ui:1.10.0.301|随其他SDK刷新版本号。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-sdk:1.10.0.301|**新增特性** * 新增音频格式获取相关接口和方法，相关代码示例见[获取音频格式](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/featured_functions-0000001178963356#section167952320408)： * [com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk.bean](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/bean_overview-0000001172171926)新增[HAEAudioFormat](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioformat-0000001507446413)。 * [HAEAudioExpansion](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioexpansion-0000001110926740)新增[getAudioFormat(String inAudioPath)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioexpansion-0000001110926740#section592718534216)。 * 新增音频格式转换相关接口和方法，相关代码示例见[转换音频格式](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/featured_functions-0000001178963356#section17831124210408)： * [com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk.bean](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/bean_overview-0000001172171926)新增[HAEAudioTransformConfig](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudiotransformconfig-0000001507526645)，[HAEAudioType](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudiotype-0000001457766696)。 * [HAEAudioExpansion](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioexpansion-0000001110926740)新增 [transformAudio(String inAudioPath, String outAudioPath, HAEAudioTransformConfig inAudioConfig, OnTransformCallBack transformCallBack)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioexpansion-0000001110926740#section19478224210)。 * 新增模型文件不存在的错误码：[HAEErrorCode](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332)新增[FAIL_NOT_EXIT_MODEL](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section11118921255)。 **修改特性** 修改格式转换失败回调返回错误信息：[OnTransformCallBack](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/ontransformcallback-0000001156926717)中onFail新增错误信息返回。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-aidubbing:1.10.0.301|随其他SDK刷新版本号。|
