### 1.8.0.301（2022-10-27）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:----------------------------------------------------------|:---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-ui:1.8.0.301|**新增特性** * 新增启动编辑界面的回调相关接口和方法： * [com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioeditorsdk-overview-0000001110929858)新增[LaunchCallback](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/launchcallback-0000001379024392)。 * [HAEUIManager](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeuimanager-0000001157086697)新增[launchEditorActivity(Context context, AudioEditorLaunchOption option, LaunchCallback callback)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeuimanager-0000001157086697#section56826492116)。 * 新增支持草稿保存和编辑相关接口、枚举和方法： * [com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioeditorsdk-overview-0000001110929858)新增[DraftCallback](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/draftcallback-0000001378864836)、[AudioEditorLaunchOption.DraftMode](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/draftmode-0000001417216241)。 * [AudioEditorLaunchOption.Builder](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioeditorlaunchoptionbuild-0000001231521724)新增[setDraftId(String id)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioeditorlaunchoptionbuild-0000001231521724#section12640163217316)、[setDraftMode(DraftMode mode)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioeditorlaunchoptionbuild-0000001231521724#section476023410412)。 * [HAEUIManager](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeuimanager-0000001157086697)新增[copyProjectById(String draftId, String newDraftName, DraftCallback callback)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeuimanager-0000001157086697#section56672492579)、[deleteDrafts(List<String> draftIds, DraftCallback callback)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeuimanager-0000001157086697#section49122111312)、[getDraftList()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeuimanager-0000001157086697#section35461827717)、[updateProjectName(String draftId, String newName, DraftCallback callback)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeuimanager-0000001157086697#section12140194418110)。 * 新增草稿信息和操作失败的相关类： * [com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.ui.api](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/ui-api-overview-0000001156929831)新增[DraftInfo](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/draftinfo-0000001429093269)。 * [com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioeditorsdk-overview-0000001110929858)新增[FailContent](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/failcontent-0000001426555125)和[FailContent.ErrorDetail](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/failcontent-errordetail-0000001376599006)。 相关代码示例可参见[音频编辑UI SDK集成](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/client-dev-0000001107465102)的步骤[4](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/client-dev-0000001107465102#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001107465102__li163816361087)和步骤[5](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/client-dev-0000001107465102#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001107465102__li79748464364)。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-sdk:1.8.0.301|**新增特性** * 新增通用版变声可设置类型：赛博朋克（CYBERPUNK）、合成器（SYNTH）、混响（MIX）、星际战争（WAR），新增类型在[VoiceTypeCommon](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/voicetypecommon-0000001367830105)中定义。 * 新增获取资源的变声类型方法：[HAEAudioAsset](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeaudioasset-0000001217779059)新增[getVoiceType()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeaudioasset-0000001217779059#section71171259131220)。 * 新增音频波形图数据失败回调：[HAEAudioVolumeCallback](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudiovolumecallback-0000001173853918)新增[onAudioFail(int errorCode, String errorMsg)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudiovolumecallback-0000001173853918#section16417857317)。 * 新增草稿相关错误码：[HAEErrorCode](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332)新增[ERR_DRAFT_ID_NOT_CERTIFIED](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1146671919187)、[ERR_DRAFT_NAME](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section13965820151815)、[ERR_DRAFT_NOT_EXIST](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1431792271817)、[ERR_EXTERNAL_STORAGE_MOUNT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section482750172310)、[ERR_IO](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section16828172319183)、[ERR_MAX_DRAFT_LIMIT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section18159152541814)、[ERR_NAME_LIMIT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section6484426181820)、[ERR_NO_STORAGE_SPACE](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section113716309183)。 **删除特性** applyNoise(byte[] pcmData, int mBitDepth, int mChannelCount, int mSampleRate)被删除，建议使用[HAENoiseReductionStream](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haenoisereductionstream-0000001190927073)。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-aidubbing:1.8.0.301|**删除特性** 删除获取扩展字段方法：[HAEAiDubbingWarn](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/emotionttswarn-0000001202523413)删除getExtension()。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-separation:1.8.0.301|**新增特性** 新增[音频编辑音源分离SDK集成](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/audio-source-separation-0000001491413848)。 将音源分离能力从原子能力中拆分，作为独立SDK发布。|

