### 1.7.0.300（2022-08-27）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:---------------------------------------------------------|:---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-ui:1.7.0.300|**优化特性** 支持适配Android 13，适配targetSdkVersion升级到33。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-sdk:1.7.0.300|**新增特性** * 新增变声（通用版，支持带背景音）的文件、流式及枚举接口：[com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioeditorsdk-overview-0000001110929858)新增[HAEChangeVoiceFileCommon](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haechangevoicefilecommon-0000001367726973)、[HAEChangeVoiceStreamCommon](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haechangevoicestreamcommon-0000001367678821)和[VoiceTypeCommon](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/voicetypecommon-0000001367830105)，相关代码示例可参见[变声（通用版-支持带背景音乐）](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/featured_functions-0000001178963356#section144171950121112)、[流式接口](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/featured_functions-0000001178963356#section6391173915407)。 * 新增声音美化流式及枚举接口：[com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioeditorsdk-overview-0000001110929858)新增[HAEVoiceBeautifierStream](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haevoicebeautifierstream-0000001317980236)和[VoiceBeautifierType](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/voicebeautifiertype-0000001369154233)，相关代码示例可参见[流式接口](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/featured_functions-0000001178963356#section6391173915407)。 * 新增资源裁剪枚举：[com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk.lane](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_overview-0000001217673891)新增[HAELane.HAETrimType](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haelane-haetrimtype-0000001305653988)。 * 新增资源片段基类的相关方法：[HAEAsset](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeasset-0000001217699109)新增[copy()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeasset-0000001217699109#section73617810181)、[getDuration()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeasset-0000001217699109#section689102332112)、[getOriginLength()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeasset-0000001217699109#section743710278229)、[getPath()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeasset-0000001217699109#section3741174120226)、[getTrimIn()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeasset-0000001217699109#section173834113237)、[getTrimOut()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeasset-0000001217699109#section20190212142318)、[getUuid()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeasset-0000001217699109#section7648321172320)。 * 新增泳道片段基类的相关方法：[HAELane](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508)新增[cutAsset(int index, long time, HAELane.HAETrimType type)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508#section647112818317)、[getAssetByIndex(int index)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508#section5936953123211)、[getAssetByUuid(String uuid)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508#section8278443334)、[getDuration()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508#section1256121103314)、[getEndTime()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508#section3126632143312)、[getStartTime()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508#section1495755173312)、[removeAllAssets()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508#section135771720143417)、[removeAsset(int index, boolean isReduceDuration)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508#section11834181101812)、[splitAsset(int index, long splitPoint)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/lane_haelane-0000001172439508#section5241055173412)。 **修改特性** 废弃音频格式转换导出到默认路径的方法：[HAEAudioExpansion](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioexpansion-0000001110926740)废弃[transformAudioUseDefaultPath(Context context, String inAudioPath, String transform, OnTransformCallBack transformCallBack)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioexpansion-0000001110926740#section54931345013)。 **优化特性** 支持适配Android 13，适配targetSdkVersion升级到33。 **删除特性** 删除获取资源类型方法：[HAEAsset](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/asset_haeasset-0000001217699109)删除getType()。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-aidubbing:1.7.0.300|**优化特性** 支持适配Android 13，适配targetSdkVersion升级到33。|

### 1.6.0.301（2022-07-12）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:---------------------------------------------------------|:---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-ui:1.6.0.301|**修改特性** 音源分离由原来的调用云侧能力修改为调用端侧的能力。 **优化特性** 提升首次导入音频时波形的生成效率，60分钟音频首屏波形实现1s内展示，向后拖动基本跟手。波形展示方案由原来的全部解析再展示优化为边解析边展示。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-sdk:1.6.0.301|**新增特性** * 新增[音源分离（云侧）异步接口](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/audio-source-separation-0000001491413848#section18748131907)样例代码。 解决部分场景的音源分离任务耗时过长，当用户退出应用再次进入时找不到之前任务。增加了查询接口，通过taskId维护音源分离任务全生命周期。 * 本地音源分离新增类型：伴奏、贝斯、管弦乐、鼓、带伴唱伴奏、主唱和弦乐。 * 新增接口： * [com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioeditorsdk-overview-0000001110929858)新增[AudioSeparationCreateCallBack](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationcreatecallback-0000001333903001)、[AudioSeparationTaskCallBack](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationtaskcallback-0000001268600806)和[HAEAudioSeparationAsyncFile](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioseparationasyncfile-0000001317047285)。 * [com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk.bean](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/bean_overview-0000001172171926)新增[SeparationQueryTaskResp](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/separationquerytaskresp-0000001271898284)和[SeparationQueryTaskResp.SeparationResultBean](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/separationresultbean-0000001323170005)。 * [com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk.engine.audio.thumbnail](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audio-thumbnail-overview-0000001175358578)新增[IWaveFormCallback](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/iwaveformcallback-0000001274175930)。 * 新增方法： * [HAELocalAudioSeparationFile](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haelocalaudioseparationfile-0000001232208279)新增[cancelAllTasks()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haelocalaudioseparationfile-0000001232208279#section1979616381101)和[getInstance()](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haelocalaudioseparationfile-0000001232208279#section527915352916)。 * [WaveformManager](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/thumbnailmanager-0000001221156797)新增[generateWaveThumbnailCache(List<String> fileList, CountDownLatch latch, IWaveFormCallback callback)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/thumbnailmanager-0000001221156797#section526692831816)。 * 新增字段： * [AudioSeparationType](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationtype-0000001244641183)新增[ACCOMP](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationtype-0000001244641183#section194811845158)、[BASS](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationtype-0000001244641183#section20845729181417)、[BRASS_STRING](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationtype-0000001244641183#section9106318162919)、[DRUMS](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationtype-0000001244641183#section366711561434)、[LEAD_BACK_ACC](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationtype-0000001244641183#section830832842510)、[LEAD_VOCALS](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationtype-0000001244641183#section815393163016)和[STRING](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationtype-0000001244641183#section11401445143612)。 * [HAEErrorCode](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332)新增[FAIL_TASK_PROCESSING](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section17921319121117)、[FAIL_TIMEOUT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1226662120119)、[FAIL_WISEGUARD](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section497512365151)、[SEPARATE_TASK_NOT_FOUND](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1820810415482)、[TASKS_DAY_LIMIT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section06533620138)和[TASKS_MONTH_LIMIT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section112601237171318)。 **修改特性** * 本地音源分离修改为单例调用，内部分离流程改为串行执行，避免同时并发的分离太多造成手机发烫或任务崩溃。 * 本地音源分离，支持分离任务指定音频取消和指定乐器取消。 * 修改方法： HAELocalAudioSeparationFile修改[cancel(String inAudioPath, String separationType)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haelocalaudioseparationfile-0000001232208279#section11418171732812)方法的参数及描述。 * 修改字段： HAEErrorCode修改[FAIL_URL_INVALID](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section64529401198)描述。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-aidubbing:1.6.0.301|**新增特性** 新增字段： [HAEAiDubbingError](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/emotionttserror-0000001202723441)新增[ERR_WISEGUARD](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/emotionttserror-0000001202723441#section4414153815121)。|

