518)、[AUDIO_ENCODE_FORMAT_DIFFERENT_SUFFIX](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section429620231575)和[FAIL_INPUT_AUDIO_DURATION_INVALID](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section57315171212)。|

