-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本：com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-ui:1.1.0.300 **新增特性** 新增添加音效、环境效果、空间方位渲染、音源分离（云侧）功能。 * 新增[com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.common.agc](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/commonagc-overview-0000001194475415)和com.huawei.hms.audioeditor.sdk.materials.network.inner.bean包。 * 新增[AudioSeparationCallBack](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioseparationcallback-0000001190927067)、[ChangeSoundCallback](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/changesoundcallback-0000001145007220)和[SeparationCloudCallBack](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/separationcloudcallback-0000001192440249)接口。 * 新增[AudioParameters](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/audioparameters-0000001193260789)、[HAEAudioSeparationFile](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioseparationfile-0000001190927069)、[HAEChangeVoiceFile](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haechangevoicefile-0000001145007222)、[HAEChangeVoiceStream](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haechangevoicestream-0000001145167030)、[HAESceneFile](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeenvironmentfile-0000001191086909)、[HAESceneStream](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeenvironmentstream-0000001190927071)、[HAEEqualizerFile](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeequalizerfile-0000001145007224)、[HAEEqualizerStream](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeequalizerstream-0000001145167032)、[HAENoiseReductionFile](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haenoisereductionfile-0000001191086911)、[HAENoiseReductionStream](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haenoisereductionstream-0000001190927073)、[HAESoundFieldFile](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haesoundfieldfile-0000001145007226)、[HAESoundFieldStream](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haesoundfieldstream-0000001145167034)、[HAESpaceRenderFile](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haespacerenderfile-0000001191086913)和[HAETempoPitch](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haetempopitch-0000001190927075)类。 * [HAEAudioExpansion](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeaudioexpansion-0000001110926740)类中新增applyNoise(byte[] pcmData, int mBitDepth, int mChannelCount, int mSampleRate)和releaseNoise()方法【这两种方法已在1.8.0.301版本中被删除】。 * [HAEErrorCode](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332)类中新增[SUCCESS](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section6758195191516)、[AUDIO_BIT_DEPTH_NOT_SUPPORT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1897613379478)、[AUDIO_CHANNEL_COUNT_NOT_SUPPORT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section6682182124917)、[AUDIO_SAMPLE_RATE_NOT_SUPPORT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section11833149576)、[AUDIO_FORMAT_INIT_FAIL](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section060224694912)、[FAIL_OUTDIR_IS_EMPTY](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section17184141219153)、[FAIL_PARAS_INVALID](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1281815315162)、[FAIL_NO_NETWORK](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section689521911138)、[SEPARATE_FAIL_IN_WORKING](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1284144817200)、[SEPARATE_FAIL_SYSTEM](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1012310468214)、[TOKEN_INVALID](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section78682056162111)、[TASKS_LIMIT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1943862102217)、[FAIL_IN_WORKING](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section1572010597118)、[FAIL_WRITE_AUDIO](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section63451722112014)、[FAIL_OUTDIR_NOT_AVAILABLE](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section778864171416)、[FAIL_OUT_NAME_NOT_CERTIFIED](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section183951339161310)和[FAIL_INPUT_AUDIO_NOT_AVAILABLE](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/haeerrorcode-0000001111582332#section11707143111212)错误码。|

### 1.0.0.301（2021-07-15）

|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本：com.huawei.hms:audio-editor-ui:1.0.0.301 华为推出了全新的Audio Editor Kit 1.0.0.301版本，此次版本为Audio Editor Kit首个商用版本，支持导入、编辑、导出音频，帮助您快速实现自有App的音频编辑功能，欢迎广大开发者接入使用。|

